      "side": 1,
      "message": "I do agree that IBroadcastRadioFactory::registerAsService auto-generated implementation is unfortunate, but I see this as a problem of HIDL implementation, not this specific code.\n\nI think it\u0027s still better to not introduce a raw pointer here as long as this syntax is supported by treble team. All the other HAL implementations use the sp\u003c\u003e, why this one would have to be any different?",
